## Phase Decomposition

Standard v10 phase order (skip phases marked N/A):

```
RT-0 (Apophatic Gate) → RT-1 (parallel 5-agent) → Doc Alignment Gate (μ-check) → Build → Validate → RT-2 (mid-point sync) → RT-3 (A3 crystallization)
```

RT-0 = Apophatic Gate (PROCEED / OOD-REJECT / PROBE-NEEDED, eradev.md §IV).
RT-1 = 5 role agents spawn in parallel; outputs below.
Doc Alignment Gate = Coherent runs `doc_alignment` verify (see §Doc Alignment Verdict).
Build = N Builders, artifact ownership per Analyst. Validate = verify per `domain.verify.method`.
RT-2 = phantom-coherence check + ι-feedback + μ-check receipt. RT-3 = A3 + Prediction Delta + S_session.

